{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 7177300788363103174,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Requesting Prioritization",
      "source_hash": 5944558910459635927,
      "context_hash": 3750729833695014950,
      "translation": "우선순위 지정 요청",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Users can request an issue to be prioritized.",
      "source_hash": 13390869601048747552,
      "context_hash": 6606208376463238072,
      "translation": "사용자는 이슈에 대해 우선순위 지정을 요청할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Prioritization means that the relevant team (T-compiler, T-rustdoc, T-libs) will have a look at the issue and assess its priority.",
      "source_hash": 11515244728779619811,
      "context_hash": 18217462505722015603,
      "translation": "우선순위 지정은 관련 팀(T-compiler, T-rustdoc, T-libs)이 해당 이슈를 살펴보고 우선순위를 평가한다는 것을 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "rustdoc": "rustdoc",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:13.129466Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This procedure is usually reserved to *regressions*, the Rust project takes regressions seriously and these have usually priority above all the rest.",
      "source_hash": 9621122820500898748,
      "context_hash": 6133875352125957819,
      "translation": "이 절차는 보통 *회귀*를 위해 마련된 것으로, Rust 프로젝트는 회귀를 진지하게 다루며 이러한 이슈는 대개 다른 모든 것보다 우선순위가 높습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:13.129467Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "When a regression is filed using the dedicated [GitHub issue template][gh-regression-tpl], a prioritization of that issue is automatically requested.",
      "source_hash": 17899193722426187671,
      "context_hash": 15208139432724906772,
      "translation": "전용 [GitHub 이슈 템플릿][gh-regression-tpl]을 사용해 회귀가 제출되면, 해당 이슈의 우선순위 지정이 자동으로 요청됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "regression": "회귀",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:13.129467Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "To learn more about this procedure, please visit the [prioritization] documentation.",
      "source_hash": 10654867280084920793,
      "context_hash": 12690260803343086468,
      "translation": "이 절차에 대해 더 알아보려면 [prioritization] 문서를 방문하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 9083107299740547300,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On repositories configured for prioritization, any user can post a comment with:",
      "source_hash": 7704585717394716550,
      "context_hash": 2292615577811709633,
      "translation": "우선순위 지정이 구성된 저장소에서는 누구나 다음과 같은 댓글을 게시할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727625Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "which will add the `I-prioritize` label to the issue and send a notification on [Zulip][prio-alerts].",
      "source_hash": 11758478437603545079,
      "context_hash": 14382548552372881553,
      "translation": "이는 이슈에 `I-prioritize` 레이블을 추가하고 [Zulip][prio-alerts]에 알림을 전송합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "label": "레이블",
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:13.129468Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 18265893795534511512,
      "translation": "구성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727625Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by the `[prioritize]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 5333819294076495128,
      "context_hash": 5476116926316283150,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`의 `[prioritize]` 테이블을 통해 저장소에서 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727625Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 12402324727303851503,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727625Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`parser/src/command/prioritize.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/prioritize.rs) and [`src/handlers/prioritize.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/prioritize.rs).",
      "source_hash": 15195086828044587897,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`parser/src/command/prioritize.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/prioritize.rs) 및 [`src/handlers/prioritize.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/prioritize.rs)를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:07.727625Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}